sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as FlashCore API
    participant Cache as Idempotency Store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST /api/simulations/run (Key: UUID-1234)
    API->>Cache: Lookup Key(UUID-1234)
    Cache-->>API: Key Not Found
    API->>Cache: Set Status(UUID-1234, IN_PROGRESS)
    API->>DB: Execute Transaction
    DB-->>API: Transaction Committed (OrderID: 9981)
    API->>Cache: Set Status(UUID-1234, COMMITTED, ResponseData)
    API-->>Client: Network Timeout / Dropped Packet!

    Note over Client,API: Client Retries Request with Identical Key
    Client->>API: POST /api/simulations/run (Key: UUID-1234)
    API->>Cache: Lookup Key(UUID-1234)
    Cache-->>API: Cached Status=COMMITTED, Data
    API-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Deterministic Replayed Response)
    Note over DB: No Second DB Execution / Zero Double Decrement
